4. She used her Nintendo Switch for stress relief during the jungle trek, despite knowing it was not a priority use of electricity. (Verbatim: "i plugged in my switch that i'd brought with me um yeah so that can't be sane um yeah yes so that helped me")
5. She developed a large mosquito bite on her forehead due to not touching her face, which made her less aware of insects landing on her. (Verbatim: "i had a big big big big big bite um right in the middle of my head right in the center right in the middle right in the middle of my forehead")
6. She wore a bucket hat gifted by "Papa Elia" during her jungle expedition. (Verbatim: "it was actually papa elia's hat he was like you can have this for your adventure and i was like thank you")
